# m6_cores: CORE HOURS pays once. m6_pickup's input to 1849 (the sweep in probe mode and its
# long hold at 855..934 that leaves the bar at 20) plus a hold-B at 1638..1643 just after the
# core hours crate is collected. Fuel is meta state (not in the World), so the grant is paid
# by main.zig against a high-water mark on the World counter debug_cores. (Re-pinned for M7:
# the crate was collected at 1740 instead of 1383. Re-pinned for the catch-up table clock, a
# thin field runs the stage table faster: the crate came at 1340, and the hold, 1747..1756
# before, was 1346..1351, 6 frames, so the ship still flies into the crate after the release.
# Re-pinned for the mode paces, NORMAL's table clock hurrying only on an empty field: the long
# hold moved with m6_pickup's to 855..934 (it had stayed at 903..982 through the catch-up
# re-pin), the crate comes at 1632, and the short hold moved from 1346..1351 to 1638..1643,
# still 6 updates after the grab.)
# - 1632 (game tick 1361): crate collected, cores 0 -> 1, fuel 104 -> 164 (+60), score 998.
# - B 1638..1643 (6 frames = 12 ticks, 2 fuel each): 1639 is back at tick 1362, still
#   collected; 1640 (tick 1360) is before the grab: cores 0, score 898, the crate back on
#   screen. The fuel is NOT given back by the rewind: 158 (164 minus the hold's 6). 1643:
#   tick 1354, fuel 152. 1644: the release (PLAYING, no tick).
# - 1651 (tick 1361): the ship grabs the same crate again: cores 1, score 998 (the +100 is
#   World state and comes back), but the fuel stays 153 (the refill alone): cores never rises
#   above its high-water mark of 1, so nothing more is paid.
--frames 1850 --call-at "31 debug_probe" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_cores,debug_fuel,debug_score --at "934 debug_fuel == 20" --at "1631 debug_fuel == 104" --at "1632 debug_cores == 1" --at "1632 debug_fuel == 164" --at "1632 debug_score == 998" --at "1639 debug_cores == 1" --at "1640 debug_state == 5" --at "1640 debug_cores == 0" --at "1640 debug_score == 898" --at "1640 debug_pickups == 1" --at "1640 debug_fuel == 158" --at "1640 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1643 debug_game_tick == 1354" --at "1643 debug_fuel == 152" --at "1644 debug_state == 1" --at "1650 debug_cores == 0" --at "1651 debug_cores == 1" --at "1651 debug_score == 998" --at "1651 debug_fuel == 153" --at "1657 debug_fuel == 153" --at "1700 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_cores == 1"
